  "content": "<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WeS8L88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"982\" height=\"197\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2755185\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>自然指南针是一种实用物品，允许你在世界任何地方搜索生物群系的位置并查看其信息。如果你正在寻找用于定位结构的指南针，请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">探索者指南针</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>手持自然指南针时右键点击，将打开生物群系选择界面，你可以从中搜索生物群系或查看其信息</li>\n<li>Shift+右键点击可以重置指南针的状态</li>\n<li>当指南针未指向某个生物群系时，它将指向世界出生点</li>\n<li>兼容所有生物群系，包括原版和模组添加的</li>\n<li>被列入黑名单的生物群系和最大搜索距离等设置可在配置文件中调整</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>图片</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rhz4gLR.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p><p><em>在HUD上显示已找到生物群系的信息</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GTSAfqv.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p><p><em>生物群系选择界面</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vjsdZZ4.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p><p><em>生物群系信息界面</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/175k4oE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"246\"></p><p><em>树苗和原木使用矿物词典。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>整合包</strong></span></p><p>是的，你可以将这个模组用于你的整合包中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支持</strong></span></p><p>如果你喜欢这个模组并希望支持该项目，欢迎通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dNotes%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal捐赠</a>。非常感谢你的支持！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>赞助商</strong></span></p><p>本项目由BisectHosting赞助。如果你正在寻找服务器，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看他们的托管方案</a>，并在结账时使用促销码<em>Chaos</em>，首月可享25%折扣！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
